<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκσῴζω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκσαόω</span></b>  (q.v.)
			:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>preserve from
				danger, keep safe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1128
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Αἰγίσθου χερός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ ἐς φάος νεκρῶν πάρα</span>
			<i>to bring</i> him <i>safe..,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HF</u>
				1222
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐκ κινδύνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					486b
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, <i>save oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.107
			</span></i> ; also, <i>save for oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς.. βίοτον ἐκσωσοίατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					360
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῶνας ὡς ἐκσῴζεται [δένδρα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					713
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν..νῆσον
			ἐκσῳζοίατο</span> when <i>they fled for safety to</i> the
			island, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				451
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς ἐξεσώθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					751
				</span></i>
			.</div>
